<title>USA: Labor Ready authorizes share buyback.</title>
<headline>Labor Ready authorizes share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labor Ready Inc said its board of directors authorized a repurchase of up to 200,000 shares from time to time on the open market.</p>
<p>In a statment it said it believes its stock offers &quot;tremendous value.&quot;</p>
</text>
